    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25457" root="ضبث" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُبَاثٌ</span></b>  The <i>nails</i> of the lion. (K, * TA.) [See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضَابِثُ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الضُّبَاثُ</span>, (O, K, TA, in the
CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الضَّباثُ</span>, but it is) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُرَاب</span>, (TA,) [is a
name of] <i>The lion;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الضَّبُوثُ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الضَّبِثُ</span></b> ,
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المِضْبَثُ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُضْطَبِثُ</span></b> . (O, K.)

